{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43081","headline":"妾薄命 · 常理","name":"妾薄命","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十五玉童色，双蛾青弯弯。\n鸟衔樱桃花，此时刺绣闲。\n娇小恣所爱，误人金指环。\n艳花句引落，灭烛屏风关。\n妾怕愁中画，君偷薄里还。\n初谓来心平若案，谁知别意险如山。\n乍啼罗袖娇遮面，不忍看君莫惜颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常理","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43081.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43081","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}